┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ In: how to derive a key, and how a key reaches each medium.
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ Out: where any tool chooses to display the result.
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ A pure function from a key to bytes, a name or a string is in. A side effect — a
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ file under ~/.local/share, a D-Bus call — is out. That test decides every symbol.
