┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ vectors.json by its own suite — 26 tests, and `derive` prints the shape
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ `validate` expects so the copy can be checked from outside:
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ repository-identicon validate -- console-colophon derive
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ Its ICON_PREFIX is `console-colophon`; the specification fixes the short id
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ and leaves the prefix to the implementing tool.
