┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=1.2
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=1.4
┋┋┋ ━ seed drift
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ What this repository would seed as today, differing from what is recorded. Reported, never acted on.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=6.1
┋┋┋ ━ masking
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ An override in force while the git remote says something else.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=6.1
┋┋┋ ━ reseed / remap
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The two deliberate acts that move a mark: reseed adopts today's seed, remap keeps the seed and moves the mapping.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=6.1
┋┋ ━ The mark
┋┋┋ ━ the mark
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The grid and the colour together — what a reader recognises.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.11
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.12
┋┋┋ ━ grid
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The 5×5 of booleans, from digest characters 0–14, drawn down the centre column and mirrored outwards.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.2
┋┋┋ ━ hue
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ A fraction of a turn, from the last seven digest characters.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.3
┋┋┋ ━ the warp
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The raised-cosine reweighting that makes the hue advance faster through the blue-green arc.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.4
┋┋┋ ━ lightness / chroma
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ Oklab. Lightness is held at 0.60 for every hue; chroma is capped at 0.26, not flattened.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.8
┋┋┋ ━ gamut chroma
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The most chroma sRGB will take at that hue and lightness.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.5
┋┋ ━ Geometry
┋┋┋ ━ block
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The pixel edge of one grid cell — the specified quantity.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.5
┋┋┋ ━ border
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The margin in pixels on each side. Chrome rather than content.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.5
┋┋┋ ━ canvas
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ 5·block + 2·border. Always derived, never specified.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.5
┋┋┋ ━ fitting
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ Choosing the largest block that fits a canvas someone else fixed.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.6
┋┋ ━ Names
┋┋┋ ━ short id
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The first 12 characters of sha256(key).
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.1
┋┋┋ ━ discriminator
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The first 6, for telling apart two projects sharing a basename.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.1
┋┋┋ ━ project name
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The last /-separated segment of the key, or all of it.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.2
┋┋┋ ━ badge label
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ One or two upper-case characters, for a medium that can show no more.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=3.3
