┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=1.4
┋┋┋ ━ prior
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ stem.prior.suffix — the bytes a run replaced, kept one level deep.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=6.6
┋┋┋ ━ current
